abstract: >-
  Tesseract LSTM models for N'Ko script (ߒߞߏ) optical character
  recognition — the writing system of Manding languages (Bambara,
  Maninka, Dioula). v2 achieves 6.26% character error rate. First
  usable open-source N'Ko OCR, built from scratch (Oct 2026).
